  "content": {
    "id": "p23-q7-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "My watch has 6 functions, which the silver button goes through in order when I push it. If I push the button 74 times, how many more times must I push the button to get it back to the start? Use modulo arithmetic.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "4 more times.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}74&=6\\times12+2\\\\74&\\equiv2\\pmod6\\\\74+4&\\equiv0\\pmod6\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe watch is two functions past the start, so another $6-2=4$ presses return it to the start.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 24
  },
